  "id": "9c48fb5d0f9421b97c78ce99",
  "title": "红烧排骨.十月的餐桌",
  "summary": "人在阻止自己幸福这方面，表现得异常机灵。我感到一个人承受不幸的能力越小，就越容易屈从于不幸。 《纪德日记》安德烈·纪德 丨红烧排骨丨 今日为自己和家人制作的是红烧排骨。因为橘子想要少油的版本，于是我也改进了自己的制作流程。排骨没有用油煸炒，而是直接加水、酱油、醋、盐和糖直接先烧软入味。等要开饭时，再将烧软的排骨捞起来，用一点植物油底油爆香蒜粒、大葱、干红辣椒，将捞出沥干水分的排骨下锅里快速滑锅，并淋一小勺老抽，翻炒均匀即可出锅装盘啦。 这样做出来的排骨，油很少，大葱蒜粒的香气扑鼻，吃起来没有什么负担，每个人都吃得很高兴。 晚餐我做的是猪肉末炒芽菜，配上煮的毛豆和带壳花生，还有一碗小番茄和冬枣。 晚饭时，橘子一边吃一边和我聊已经离开我们这里去大姐家居住的橘母。 他讲：“她一辈子按照某种社会时钟在走人生，她的生命…",
  "content": "<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>人在阻止自己幸福这方面，表现得异常机灵。我感到一个人承受不幸的能力越小，就越容易屈从于不幸。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><span><span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>《纪德日记》安德烈·纪德</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h3><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span> 丨红烧排骨丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><div><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi3UmZrsl9bdxNsAkCB2QWYM48y9uG07NdFewQ8ZSvD1RbXJjZa9xYIWooxYuRQD400qytRzez6FFWIPrjrgj2y5Bx1J6u8vp1T708OFX5zz5JZAok4pBwbV9I-ourkdcB6ZNqKrw-_lJTMiNAMejVIq3Wpnkd9DYh73WPDTVWQKNncs-HBRq-n2LOqq9zS/s1702/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20261011184155_520_20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi3UmZrsl9bdxNsAkCB2QWYM48y9uG07NdFewQ8ZSvD1RbXJjZa9xYIWooxYuRQD400qytRzez6FFWIPrjrgj2y5Bx1J6u8vp1T708OFX5zz5JZAok4pBwbV9I-ourkdcB6ZNqKrw-_lJTMiNAMejVIq3Wpnkd9DYh73WPDTVWQKNncs-HBRq-n2LOqq9zS/w482-h640/%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87_20261011184155_520_20.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></div><br><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今日为自己和家人制作的是红烧排骨。因为橘子想要少油的版本，于是我也改进了自己的制作流程。排骨没有用油煸炒，而是直接加水、酱油、醋、盐和糖直接先烧软入味。等要开饭时，再将烧软的排骨捞起来，用一点植物油底油爆香蒜粒、大葱、干红辣椒，将捞出沥干水分的排骨下锅里快速滑锅，并淋一小勺老抽，翻炒均匀即可出锅装盘啦。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>这样做出来的排骨，油很少，大葱蒜粒的香气扑鼻，吃起来没有什么负担，每个人都吃得很高兴。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>晚餐我做的是猪肉末炒芽菜，配上煮的毛豆和带壳花生，还有一碗小番茄和冬枣。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>晚饭时，橘子一边吃一边和我聊已经离开我们这里去大姐家居住的橘母。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>他讲：“她一辈子按照某种社会时钟在走人生，她的生命力刻满了时刻表，比如多少岁结婚，多少岁生娃，多少岁绝经说自己老了，再比如7点吃早饭，12点正吃午饭，17点正吃晚饭，结果来到我们这里发现一切都乱糟糟的，所有事情或早或晚，时刻表一刻不停在挪动，早上10点30了，媳妇还没有起床，下午15点了媳妇终于说午饭好了，晚上20点，媳妇儿说吃晚饭。而且记下这个时间没有啥鸟用，明天媳妇儿9点30又爬起来了，后天媳妇儿11点了还没有出现，在我们这里，变动不拘的时刻表才是永恒的主题，所以这导致了大量的冲突。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“再者，”橘子说，“你喜欢的生黄瓜和生小番茄，在我妈眼里超级不养生，经常还是冰的就开始吃了。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“噢！你看营养学鼓励我们在饮食里增加一些生食的完整蔬果。”我笑起来，我说，“她在这里，我晚上还没有做面包片夹煎蛋配生番茄给她吃呢，若是做了面包三明治出来，你说她会吃吗？”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>“绝对不会吃，还会打电话到处向我姐姐投诉。”橘子剥着毛豆说，“祝她在大姐家过得开心。”</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><br></p><h3><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨香煎鸭腿丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>最近我做鸭腿时，采取的做法是先将鸭腿红烧一遍，把将鸭腿烧透烧软。我不会单独烧鸭腿，这个步骤是合并到其他菜品制作时搭着烧的。比如，中午的正餐是吃红烧肉，那么在煮红烧肉时，顺便把鸭腿放进去一起烧了。吃红烧肉时，将鸭腿捞出来放冰箱，鸭腿是另一餐的主角。有时候我会把烧好的鸭腿在冰箱里放一晚。冰箱的风冷可以将鸭肉的水分抽得比较干。第二天吃的时候，将锅烧热，下油，等油温上来了，将鸭腿下到油锅里，两面煎一下，淋一勺生抽下去，等鸭腿表皮变成红褐色，就可以捞出来摆盘吃。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>橘子很喜欢这种做法。每次吃的时候都感觉无比幸福。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><h3><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>丨简版麻婆豆腐丨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>今天中午，做的是肉末豆腐，在豆腐里，我放了很多花椒粉，嘿，我们可以将其视为减配版本的麻婆豆腐，毕竟我没有放郫县豆瓣嘛。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>肉末豆腐的味道很好，大家唏里呼噜把一大盆几乎吃光了。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>另一份菜</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>是用芋头清炖的猪瘦肉丁。这两种食材凑在一起，虽然成品看起来白白的似乎寡淡，但其实滋味鲜美。在芋头炖瘦肉丁里，我只放盐、胡椒和一点大葱碎。芋头入口即化，瘦肉自有其鲜味，汤汁浓稠。拌在米饭里，吃起来非常幸福。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><div><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgooKJrardMXrjoFuV2A2J3eMM7V1cGUONBI933vzjjTAx74QtMOmw1rhnuASKLxU4U9Bl5wGQPv59JE4UX4lZ1O-NyLgAOS8wNKlMpz959NjEUXQUNvgDUDO7fcc4D5n6QbpYEabvQ1HrmpBEqUJKaC1XwD40b4DmSn68wXLQqtNICn6MFrlor-DSfNU4c/s1702/IMG20261020145214.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgooKJrardMXrjoFuV2A2J3eMM7V1cGUONBI933vzjjTAx74QtMOmw1rhnuASKLxU4U9Bl5wGQPv59JE4UX4lZ1O-NyLgAOS8wNKlMpz959NjEUXQUNvgDUDO7fcc4D5n6QbpYEabvQ1HrmpBEqUJKaC1XwD40b4DmSn68wXLQqtNICn6MFrlor-DSfNU4c/w482-h640/IMG20261020145214.jpg\" width=\"482\"></a></span></span></span></span></div><span><span><span><span><br>丨写在最后丨<span></span>\n在家务生活之外，我同时也是个手艺人，平日靠销售手工艺品谋生。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n在我看来，做菜和做手工虽然是两件事，但背后有相似的快乐。我通过自己的观察和尝试，逐渐掌握一件事，并让它越来越符合自己的喜好。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n这种快乐不见得需要扩展成商业规模。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n我把一道菜做得越来越美味，不是为了开餐馆。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n我将剑穗做得日益漂亮，并不想把手工作坊扩张成企业。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n我写下这些经验，留给未来的自己，也让偶然读到日志的人分享其中的乐趣。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n这些事情本身就有令人快乐的价值。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n我记录的都是具体的琐事，并非抽象的我要做自己。我正在练习将视线聚焦在当下，回归生活本身。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n我生活所有的一切，就是此时此刻已在发生的事情。我不需要等到富足了才成为那个自由生活的人。<span></span>\n<span></span>\n我现在做的每一道菜、写下的每一篇日志，都已经是那种生活的一部分。<span></span>\n</span><span><span></span></span><span>\n</span><span><span></span></span></span></span></span><p></p><p><br></p>",
